# The minimal "Tap me" counter benchmark app, shared source compiled for every
# delivery mode (compiled-Swift .so, wasm reactor). Its native-Compose, Valdi,
# and React Native twins live in their own app dirs / repos; all four are behavior-
# identical so the cross-framework benchmark isolates runtime overhead, not app
# content. See docs/benchmarks.md.
filegroup(
    name = "srcs",
    srcs = glob(["*.swift"]),
    visibility = ["//visibility:public"],
)
